            <div xml:id="d771-a3">

                <pb facs="0874" n="754" xml:id="pg754"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Decision of the admiralty court, October 9/22, 1904,
                        steamer Allanton.</hi></head>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>The steamer <hi rendition="#italic">Allanton</hi> and cargo, consisting of
                        coal, to be considered as not subject to confiscation and to be set
                        free.</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>The arrest of the steamer and cargo to be considered as having been made
                        on sufficient ground.</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>The decision of the Vladivostok prize court in that part which relates to
                        the confiscation of the vessel and cargo to be reversed.</item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
